                    <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fas fa-list-check text-emerald-400"></i> 雲端編譯 4 步驟教學：
                    </h3>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <div class="bg-[#161b22] p-4 rounded-xl border border-[#30363d] space-y-2">
                            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span class="w-5 h-5 bg-emerald-500/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]">1</span>
                                建立 GitHub 儲存庫 (Repo)
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                                前往 GitHub.com 新建一個 Private 或 Public 儲存庫，例如命名為 <code class="text-slate-200 bg-slate-800 px-1">ubereats-address-helper</code>。
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-[#161b22] p-4 rounded-xl border border-[#30363d] space-y-2">
                            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span class="w-5 h-5 bg-emerald-500/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]">2</span>
                                放入專案檔案與 Actions 腳本
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                                將本站「專案原始碼庫」頁面的所有檔案依據路徑上傳，並務必包含 <code class="text-slate-200 bg-slate-800 px-1">.github/workflows/build-apk.yml</code>。
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-[#161b22] p-4 rounded-xl border border-[#30363d] space-y-2">
