                        </h3>
                        <p class="leading-relaxed">
                            1. 打開 Android Studio 點選 <strong class="text-white">New Project</strong>。<br>
                            2. 選擇 <strong class="text-emerald-400">Empty Views Activity</strong>，點擊 Next。<br>
                            3. Name 輸入：<code class="text-amber-300 bg-slate-800 px-1">UberEatsHelper</code><br>
                            4. Package name 輸入：<code class="text-amber-300 bg-slate-800 px-1">com.ubereats.helper</code><br>
                            5. Language 選擇：<strong class="text-purple-400">Kotlin</strong><br>
                            6. Minimum SDK 選擇：<strong class="text-blue-400">API 26 (Android 8.0)</strong> 以上。
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-[#161b22] p-5 rounded-xl border border-[#30363d] space-y-3">
